sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Mhs as Mahasiswa
    participant API as FastAPI KRS Router
    participant Manager as KRSManager
    participant Chain as KRSValidationChain
    participant DB as SQLite Database
    actor DosenPA as Dosen PA
    participant Notif as NotificationService

    Mhs->>API: POST /api/krs/{krs_id}/submit
    API->>Manager: submit_krs(krs_id)
    Manager->>DB: SELECT krs, krs_detail, riwayat_nilai FOR UPDATE
    Manager->>Chain: validate(krs_context)

    Note over Chain: Rantai Validasi Fail-Fast (Chain of Responsibility)
    Chain->>Chain: 1. Cek Double Enrollment
    Chain->>Chain: 2. Cek Prasyarat MK (Nilai >= C)
    Chain->>Chain: 3. Cek Bentrok Jadwal Kuliah
    Chain->>Chain: 4. Cek Total Beban Studi (<= 24 SKS)

    alt Salah satu aturan validasi gagal
        Chain-->>Manager: ValidationFailure(rule_name, detail_error)
        Manager->>DB: ROLLBACK
        Manager-->>API: Raise KRSValidationError (422)
        API-->>Mhs: 422 Unprocessable Entity (Alasan penolakan)
    else Seluruh validasi lulus
        Chain-->>Manager: ValidationPassed
        Manager->>DB: UPDATE krs SET status = 'SUBMITTED'
        Manager->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        Manager->>Notif: notify_dosen_pa(dosen_pa_id, krs_id)
        Notif-->>DosenPA: Notifikasi KRS menunggu persetujuan
        Manager-->>API: KRSResponse (status='SUBMITTED')
        API-->>Mhs: 200 OK (KRS berhasil diajukan)
    end

    DosenPA->>API: POST /api/krs/{krs_id}/review (approve / revision)
    API->>Manager: review_krs(krs_id, keputusan, catatan)
    alt Dosen PA meminta revisi
        Manager->>DB: UPDATE krs SET status = 'REVISION', catatan = catatan
        Manager->>DB: COMMIT
        Manager->>Notif: notify_mahasiswa(nim, 'REVISION')
        Notif-->>Mhs: Notifikasi KRS perlu direvisi
    else Dosen PA menyetujui KRS
        Manager->>DB: UPDATE krs SET status = 'APPROVED'
        Manager->>DB: COMMIT
        Manager->>Notif: notify_mahasiswa(nim, 'APPROVED')
        Notif-->>Mhs: Notifikasi KRS disetujui
    end